  "description": "The Dream350 is our least expensive mid drive and it now comes with disc brakes.\nThe Dream350 boasts a 350W Bafang mid drive motor, Day 6’s unparalleled comfort and ergonomics, and either a 14Ah or 17.5Ah 48V lithium ion battery that locks to the down tube.\nHills and distance are no longer obstacles but conquered with comfort and ease.\n\nEach Dream350 features a color display and 44 tooth chainring.\n\n(If you are over 275 pounds upgrade to the Ultra750HD)\n\n(The Dream350 does not come with a throttle as they add extra complexity to mid drives which can put extra stress on the motor.)",
